        "cooked": "<p><font color=\"green\"><span class=\"bbcode-i\">&lt;Accidentally split off of <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/doubled-damage-modifiers-5574#comment-75001\">the Double Damage Modifier thread</a>.&gt;</span></font></p>\n<p>Shock Rounds go off once then destroy themselves. See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/expatriette%20-%20shock%20-%20rounds%20-%20and%20-%20submachine%20-%20gun\">this thread</a>.</p>\n<p>Basically you get the first instance of damage from the gun (whatever that is), Shock Rounds do a point to all non-heroes, Shock Rounds destroy themselves, then the rest of the gun's instances of damage happen (one at a time).</p>",
