        "raw": "[quote=\"Rabit\"]\n\nShock Rounds go off once then destroy themselves. See <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/expatriette - shock - rounds - and - submachine - gun\" rel=\"nofollow\">this thread</a>.Basically you get the first instance of damage from the gun (whatever that is), Shock Rounds do a point to all non-heroes, Shock Rounds destroy themselves, then the rest of the gun&#39;s instances of damage happen (one at a time).\n\n[/quote]\n\nThat would then apply to all ammo cards; or do Hollow Points last for the entire burst since they boost the damage power of the gun card itself rather than generating an effect before destroying themselves?\n\n(And the thread link you supplied appears to be broken)\n",
